    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You bob, swerve, dip, and dive to avoid incoming shots and other attacks.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hovering\" title=\"Hovering\">Hovering</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flying\" title=\"Flying\">Flying</a> Locomotion, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> 13, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dodge\" title=\"Dodge\">Dodge</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> You can reduce your Speed by up to 2 squares to increase your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dodge\" title=\"Dodge\">Dodge</a> bonus by 1 for each square of speed you give up, until the start of your next turn. You must move at least 2 squares to gain this benefit.</p><p><b>Special:</b> To use this Feat you must be equipped with and using <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hovering\" title=\"Hovering\">Hovering</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flying\" title=\"Flying\">Flying</a> Locomotion.</p>",
